  characterDescription: "Ricochet is a long ranged fighter who mixes powerful\nattacks
    with a slew of gadgets to overwhelm enemies.\n\nInstead of SP, Ricochet has bullets,
    which are consumed by\nusing attacks with his gun. Ricochet has different types
    of\nbullets with different effects, but starts each campaign with\ntwo critical
    bullets, six regular, and one misfire. His bullet\norder is always random, but
    can be revealed by select \nabilities.\n\n<u>Critical</u>: The ability always
    scores a critical hit.\n<u>Normal</u>: No effect.\n<u>Misfire</u>: The abilities
    deals no damage."
